# See https://help.github.com/articles/ignoring-files/ for more about ignoring files.

##### Node / Next.js (monorepo-safe)
**/node_modules/
**/.next/
**/out/
**/dist/
**/build/
**/.turbo/
# Vercel
**/.vercel/

##### Yarn / pnpm
**/.pnp
.pnp.*
.yarn/*
!.yarn/patches
!.yarn/plugins
!.yarn/releases
!.yarn/versions

##### Testing coverage
**/coverage/

##### Misc
.DS_Store
*.pem

##### Debug logs
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
.pnpm-debug.log*

##### Env files (do not commit secrets)
**/.env
**/.env.*

##### TypeScript
*.tsbuildinfo
# next-env.d.ts is auto-generated; fine to commit, but leave ignored if you prefer
# next-env.d.ts

##### Python (monorepo-safe)
**/venv/
**/.venv/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.python-version

##### Prisma (heavy engines are also ignored in backend/.gitignore)
backend/prisma_client/binaries/
backend/prisma_client/engine/

##### Supabase local CLI
**/.branches/
**/.temp/

##### Generated code
**/src/generated/prisma

##### Editors/IDE (optional)
.vscode/
.idea/
